{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/AlphaResponse_Logo.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Response thrusts players into the role of police officers from around the world. Your mission is to respond to crisis situations that require precise and lethal force in order to avoid civilian casualties. Players will have to work together and react to an extremely dynamic environment that includes a wide range of enemy combatants and innocent bystanders. Protect Society and bring order to a chaotic world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EliteForces.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As criminal and terrorist organizations have expanded their operations across borders, a multi-national initiative has formed that will allow police from various countries to work more closely. Players will choose to play as a variety of different police units from around the world to combat the criminal and terrorist organizations that wreak havoc on the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play singleplayer or with up to 4 player co-operatively. The action never stops and teamwork is essential to accomplishing the harder missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/PlayAsElitePolice.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_NonLinear_Missions.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Response features a variety of dynamic non-linear missions, such as hostage rescue, bomb defusal, Escorting a VIP, and more. Many missions can be approached from a variety of different ways and the enemies will appear in different locations each time the mission is played. Players must always be careful as each playthrough will be a different experience and they must adapt their tactics to the unique situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/DynamicMissions.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_Dynamic_OpenLevels.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Missions will take place in a large open level filled with innocent civilians  which must be protected at all times. Players will fight in a variety of environments that take place indoors and outdoors, from city streets, huge metro stations, cathedrals, industrial factories and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/OpenWorldLevel.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EnemyVariety.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large variety of enemies will challenge the player and require different methods in order to defeat them effectively.\u00a0 Enemies will include human combatants and vicious attack dogs, as well as vehicles such as armored cars and helicopters\u00a0which will be used to transport enemies into a mission zone or attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/EnemyVariety.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_WeaponArsenal.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will have access to a wide variety of weaponry and equipment. Weapons include pistols, shotguns, submachine guns, rifles, grenade launchers and more. The player can also use shields, grenades, and drive vehicles. You will need utilize all of these tools effectively in order to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/WeaponVariety.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2089250?t=1746502644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746502644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/4e24e20e4f5e64e112bc648558d42b08757421a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746502644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/4e24e20e4f5e64e112bc648558d42b08757421a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746502644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players will play as police and will be killing criminal gangsters and terrorists.\r\n\r\nThere will be civilians in the game but players are not encouraged to harm them. They must protect them and will be penalized in the game if they hurt any civilians"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/AlphaResponse_Logo.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Response thrusts players into the role of police officers from around the world. Your mission is to respond to crisis situations that require precise and lethal force in order to avoid civilian casualties. Players will have to work together and react to an extremely dynamic environment that includes a wide range of enemy combatants and innocent bystanders. Protect Society and bring order to a chaotic world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EliteForces.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As criminal and terrorist organizations have expanded their operations across borders, a multi-national initiative has formed that will allow police from various countries to work more closely. Players will choose to play as a variety of different police units from around the world to combat the criminal and terrorist organizations that wreak havoc on the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play singleplayer or with up to 4 player co-operatively. The action never stops and teamwork is essential to accomplishing the harder missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/PlayAsElitePolice.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_NonLinear_Missions.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Response features a variety of dynamic non-linear missions, such as hostage rescue, bomb defusal, Escorting a VIP, and more. Many missions can be approached from a variety of different ways and the enemies will appear in different locations each time the mission is played. Players must always be careful as each playthrough will be a different experience and they must adapt their tactics to the unique situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/DynamicMissions.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_Dynamic_OpenLevels.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Missions will take place in a large open level filled with innocent civilians  which must be protected at all times. Players will fight in a variety of environments that take place indoors and outdoors, from city streets, huge metro stations, cathedrals, industrial factories and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/OpenWorldLevel.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EnemyVariety.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large variety of enemies will challenge the player and require different methods in order to defeat them effectively.\u00a0 Enemies will include human combatants and vicious attack dogs, as well as vehicles such as armored cars and helicopters\u00a0which will be used to transport enemies into a mission zone or attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/EnemyVariety.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_WeaponArsenal.png?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will have access to a wide variety of weaponry and equipment. Weapons include pistols, shotguns, submachine guns, rifles, grenade launchers and more. The player can also use shields, grenades, and drive vehicles. You will need utilize all of these tools effectively in order to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/WeaponVariety.gif?t=1746502644\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ultimo Ratio Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/header.jpg?t=1746502644","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Ultimo Ratio Games Inc. Alpha Response is developed by Ultimo Ratio Games Inc. Alpha Response and its logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Ultimo Ratio Games Inc. All other trademarks or registered trademarks belong to their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135337,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_